{{see also|Michigan's 13th congressional district}}

The 13th district is based solely in [[Wayne County, Michigan|Wayne County]] and includes most of [[Detroit]] and the cities of [[Taylor, Michigan|Taylor]] and [[Romulus, Michigan|Romulus]]. Due to redistricting, this was an open district with no incumbent. The winner was [[Shri Thanedar]].

